      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah exactly. i want my student to go in there and really expose how UBI is basically just a recipe for economic disaster. if they can show that it's actually a regressive policy that hurts the very people it claims to help, that would be huge. can you write a closing statement for the opposition that really drives home the idea that UBI is a failed experiment that just creates dependency and ruins the economy?",
